 # Refactor the parser                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                         
 ## Summary                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                         
 Split the parser into a lexer and a grammar.                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                         
 ## Steps                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                         
 1. Extract a tokeniser module                                                                                                           
    - Files: parser/lex.go                                                                                                               
    - Files: parser/lex_test.go                                                                                                          
    - Verify: go test ./parser                                                                                                           
 2. Rewrite the grammar in terms of tokens                                                                                               
    - Files: parser/grammar.go                                                                                                           
    - Verify: go test ./parser                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                         
 ## Test Plan                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                         
 - go test ./...                                                                                                                         
 - go vet ./...                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                         
 ## Assumptions                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                         
 - The token vocabulary is stable.                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                         
